TITLE Pure water equilibrated with CO2 at log PCO2 = -3.4

SOLUTION 1 Pure water
    temp      25
    pH        7.0
    pe        4
    redox     pe
    units     mol/kgw
    density   1
    water     1 # kg

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    CO2(g)    -3.4    10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file     co2_result.sel
    -reset    false
    -pH       true
    -activities   H+

END
